            <ArticleTitle>[Heel pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>535-8; discussion 538-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Heel pain is quite frequent clinical symptom in our population. Successful therapy derives from the problem aetiology. The most frequent source of pain is the mechanical basis, both on dorsal and plantar side of calcaneum. Therapy includes a variety of procedures, from routine measures to surgical intervention.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
